      "title": "Lunch at Mama Rosa's",
      "word_count": 96,
      "text": "Today, my family is having lunch at Mama Rosa's restaurant. There is a nice table for four near the window. Our waiter brings us the menu. There are many delicious dishes to choose from. My mother orders a soup, and my father orders fish with rice. I want a sandwich and an orange juice. There are also many desserts on the menu. My sister orders a chocolate cake for dessert. The chef at Mama Rosa's is very famous in our city. At the end, the waiter brings us the bill, and we pay together.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "q": "How many people are having lunch?",
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "Two",
            "Three",
            "Four",
            "Five"
          ],
          "answer": "Four"
        },
        {
          "q": "What does the father order?",
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "Soup",
            "A sandwich",
            "Fish with rice",
            "Chocolate cake"
          ],
          "answer": "Fish with rice"
